1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:24,000
We sign in to the real LIFEOS workspace, switch to light mode, and begin with the user's intent.

2
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Real authenticated provider surfaces: Gmail, Calendar, Discord, WhatsApp, and Drive.

3
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The overview turns one change into a consequence graph with dependencies.

4
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Action review exposes the exact target, risk, arguments, and reversibility.

5
00:01:36,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Execution moves through approved, executing, verified, and resolved states.

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:24,000
The connected application record keeps the context behind every action inspectable.

7
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:48,000
My Work and Calendar connect automation to the work that follows.

8
00:02:48,000 --> 00:03:12,000
Integrations make provider permissions and connection boundaries explicit.

9
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Audit Trail preserves approvals, attempts, receipts, and verification evidence.

10
00:03:36,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Settings and the final overview show a complete, controlled productivity operating system.
